      "widgets_values": [
        "Highest priority: preserve the exact facial identity and recognizable appearance of the main person. Do not change face shape, eyes, nose, mouth, skin characteristics, hairstyle, or recognizable identity unless the instruction explicitly asks for it. Keep the result natural and coherent. Treat Image 1 as the identity anchor. All other reference images must influence clothing, pose, style, material, or lighting only, not the person's identity. Image 1 is the main target. Image 2 and Image 3 are reference images. Apply the relevant visual information from the reference images to the target while preserving the target person's identity and keeping the final result coherent. Example: use the outfit from Image 2 and the environment mood from Image 3 while keeping the main person's face and body recognizable."
      ],
